# Emitted by `db:seed` from src/seed.ts. Generated, and large enough that a diff
# of it belongs in a review of the seed rather than in the tree.
seed.sql

# Also emitted by `db:seed`, and ignored for the same reason — but it would be ignored
# even if it were small. It carries a password hash for every seeded account, and the
# password behind it is written in plain text in src/seed.ts. Both facts belong in a
# local database; neither belongs in a commit.
seed-credentials.sql
